cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "getopendatafvg"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that extracts open geographic, socio-economic and
  environmental data for a comune or area of Friuli Venezia Giulia (Italy):
  the regional WFS GeoServer and Open Data portal, ISTAT statistics,
  cadastral parcels, OpenStreetMap, and Sentinel-2/Landsat imagery, with
  documented upstream defects handled and tested against the live services.
